# Applies only to the kenn-ts image build (docker/kenn-ts/Dockerfile), whose
# context is this `indexers/` dir because kenn-ts imports the shared frames.ts.
# Allow-list: ship only frames.ts + the kenn-ts sources; drop the other sidecars
# and all host build output.
*
!frames.ts
!kenn-ts
kenn-ts/node_modules
kenn-ts/tmp
kenn-ts/test
